{"id":"1b726801dacf2b8e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-global-T-schema.md","title":"外部给出的T-双条件实例族","display":"df-global-T-schema — 外部给出的T-双条件实例族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-global-T-schema","aliases":["91-df-global-T-schema"],"display":"df-global-T-schema — 外部给出的T-双条件实例族","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-global-T-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-global-T-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-global-T-schema — 外部给出的T-双条件实例族"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-global-T-schema-—-外部给出的-T-双条件实例族-$\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}$\">df-global-T-schema — 外部给出的 T-双条件实例族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}\">\\(\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (一元真理谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的基础语言)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}\\)</span> (句子编码的数字名)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}(\\mathcal L_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}(\\mathcal L_0)\\)</span> 是下述定义的基础语言 T-双条件实例集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{glob}\">\\(\\mathrm{glob}\\)</span> 为元层整族给定方式的下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“全局”在本条目中只表示元理论一次指定整个实例族；它仍是公理模式，\n不是对象语言中量化公式的单个句子，也不自带任何推导关系。\n若要断言一个具体理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> 证明每个实例，应使用\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fba702593996a2b2\" href=\"?note=fba702593996a2b2\" title=\"91-df-local-T-schema\">91-df-local-T-schema</a> 所定义的理论性质。</p>\n<p>实例域被明确限制为不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>。若在经典逻辑中把\n同一个谓词的全透明双条件扩到所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句子，对角引理产生的\n说谎者实例会导致矛盾。无类型理论必须改用受限公理、推理规则或非经典\n语义，不能把“无类型”理解为自动拥有全语言 T-schema。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-global-T-schema-—-外部给出的-T-双条件实例族-$\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}$","text":"df-global-T-schema — 外部给出的 T-双条件实例族 $\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-local-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"fba702593996a2b2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"“全局”在本条目中只表示元理论一次指定整个实例族；它仍是公理模式，\n不是对象语言中量化公式的单个句子，也不自带任何推导关系。\n若要断言一个具体理论 $\\mathcal T_T$ 证明每个实例，应使用\n[[91-df-local-T-schema]] 所定义的理论性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}(\\mathcal L_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{glob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{T\\text{-}schema}_{\\mathrm{glob}}(\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":1720,"backlinks":[{"id":"fba702593996a2b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元